Limited evidence of decision documentation. A small number of decisions may be recorded but there is no consistent approach.
</td>
<td class="nhsuk-table__cell">
Informal notes.<br>
Meeting minutes.<br>
Incomplete decision records.<br>
Unstructured documentation.
